            "description": "Full lead qualification. This payload scores the maximum 100:\n  form_intent 30 (demo) + firmographic 25 (1000+) + job_title 25 (CISO) + behavioral 20\n\nExpected: tier `enterprise_ae`, SLA 1 hour out, and jobs queued for slack_alert, calendar_send and ai_extract.\n\nThe message text is parsed for frameworks and urgency — check automation_events afterwards.\n\ncompany_size:        1-50 | 51-200 | 201-1000 | 1000+\nframework_interest:  soc2 | iso27001 | hipaa | gdpr | pci_dss | nist | fedramp | iso42001 | eu_ai_act | other"
          },
          "event": [
